  exerciseTitle: Scenario (To-Do)
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202509
  exerciseText: 'Needs System that contains Hunger and Thirst. The Needs go down
    over time and the player needs to consume Food and Water in order to replenish
    them, otherwise the player starts losing Health.


    In this Scenario, the
    player has needs and there are items in the world for Food and Water. The player
    can also craft more complex food items that feed the player more than a basic
    item.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so if
    you want to keep your own personal implementation of this System then make a
    BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
